{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "485a38e0ac29789be7ed5006bf9c7c35ee82acd77214bf2c44f031e75561714a", "ja": "（莉緒たちが出演するJCCの本番まで、もうすぐ。\nスタッフさんの手配や連絡業務で手一杯だ……）", "zh": "（距离莉绪她们出演的JCC正式演出已经没多少时间了。安排工作人员和处理联络事务就已经让我忙得不可开交……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d87418ac48e071fdcc8124dae64f195c4b531e77692594c9e0a1b436ceda84ea", "ja": "あれ？　莉緒からたくさんメッセージが届いてるな。\nなんだろう……？", "zh": "咦？莉绪发了好多条消息过来啊。\n是怎么了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1002_se", "source_sha256": "36be0285cfb59f820089103968805b2b6da4c7c02c24e9fcdbffa17c9c170ab1", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ！", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1003_p", "source_sha256": "986dfba55637faf9259803de8d87c3f9b121bbfd487962188146e0d7dd459238", "ja": "っと、仕事の電話だ……はい、もしもし！\nいつもお世話になっております。先日は……、……", "zh": "糟糕，是工作的电话……喂，你好！\n您好，一直以来承蒙关照。前些天……，……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1004_se", "source_sha256": "c6af9f13f697a30aeebc02a2f5949b2e512c6b01042b7156ebcfbd7876364c13", "ja": "バンッ！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "e6db0ec36dc687ce06c9a52e0858c70b5e9f565069a76142684d156e44f763bd", "ja": "ちょっと{$P$}くん！\nなんで既読スルーするの？　私のこと、無視しないで！", "zh": "喂，{$P$}君！\n干嘛已读不回？别无视我呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1006_p", "source_sha256": "be225b1d3bf7785e0f0c8fa26e3b38efe32b071c9ba631bcbcf2a6773a3186e5", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、ごめんごめん。\nちょっと立て込んでて……！", "zh": "咦？啊，抱歉抱歉。\n刚才有点忙不过来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "e0a13bfb595f513d20a1fb250a52bf992821edb9c5e439fd56e156c249bcf9cb", "ja": "仕事仕事って……仕事と私、どっちが大事なの！\n私のことをわかってくれるのは、キミだけなのに！", "zh": "整天工作工作个没完……工作和我，哪个更重要！\n明明只有你能理解我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "78e0de528d898ce76f000715b45fe3de5feca8d437ac1f7cfbaae52ee3a83fa2", "ja": "もしかして……仕事とかいって、本当は他の子と会う\nつもりなのね！　そうなんでしょ！　ハッキリ言って！", "zh": "难道说……你借口工作，其实是打算去见别的女孩子吧！肯定是这样对不对！给我说清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b23e48e9605b3056a4c2cd1b511c5d3e996cb67d91b01b41daf91e0352d062cb", "ja": "え？　え？　本当に、ちょっと待ってくれ。\nなんか変だぞ、莉緒？", "zh": "诶？诶？真的，稍微等一下。\n总觉得有点奇怪啊，莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "9abaeeccae3f0cea76347c16ada0f91fba88e45cd7c6d25614516bbfa844cf3a", "ja": "……もうー！　変って何よ～！？\nせっかく、『病み』を勉強してきたのに～！", "zh": "……真是的！说什么奇怪呀～！？\n我可是特地学习了“病娇”才来的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f3bb65a394b51e81cd118f1cc08ab1f0cbb87129c0e9c984754736d13528a6fa", "ja": "勉強……今のが？", "zh": "学习……刚才那算吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "02d174e307c4bcc42df3f39a7f56655aa245d12c33d1fe16c51fda884891dcfa", "ja": "そうよ！　社会人になってから、こんなに\n勉強したことないーってくらい、勉強したんだから！", "zh": "没错！工作以后，我还是第一次这么认真地学习，简直都要说从来没这么用功过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "7991703889c119b605fd4816d51c811f0ea52bfc67aac7e69d1da6acb2064688", "ja": "美也ちゃんたちとも地雷系メイクの練習したり、\n情報交換もしてね……。それは楽しかったんだけど。", "zh": "我还和美也她们一起练习了地雷系妆容，\n也交换了不少情报……。虽然那些确实很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2204551bfec2add40ec32f9dfb5f9b0334281359deeab54f111b0ff6bcc2267a", "ja": "そうか……うん、ありがとう。\nみんなを引っ張ってくれて、助かってる。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，谢谢你。\n你带着大家一起努力，帮了大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "fe98bed532b7d005734a778030b85ed8c5bcb547a6de8255d30cd4306e1f1859", "ja": "いいのよ、気にしないで。本気で戦うなら、\nやっぱりフェアじゃないと！　……そうでしょ♪", "zh": "没事的，别放在心上。既然要全力较量，\n果然还是得讲究公平才行！……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1016_p", "source_sha256": "621b9f13463d5d8b0f2db5026d8e425fcfb303c2e6f6c57087e22ab7c3da7b0d", "ja": "ははっ、確かに。\nしかし莉緒がこんなに苦戦するとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，确实。\n不过，真没想到莉绪会这么苦战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "8917201a0874a990bca78af3ef7e8c3e8ae74723c065a3829f5851d1bf89d766", "ja": "本当よ～。\nでも、『セクシーは一日にしてならず』。でしょ？", "zh": "真的啦～  \n不过，“性感可不是一天就能养成的”。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6a6c35e5dba2f29a6010e20dedad3a6611f22a9c57183f55735f1598ff491aba", "ja": "……う、うん？", "zh": "……呃、嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "cc7ba4bdd4eef7939f1a2fd16eb92e69681702198b03279c1d52cab90eafc7da", "ja": "地雷系も同じよ！　今はわからないことも多いけど、\n続けたら意味がわかるんじゃないかしら……多分！", "zh": "地雷系也是一样哦！现在还有很多不明白的地方，不过只要继续下去，应该就能明白其中的意义了吧……大概！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0533_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "a077c0ef0919fc7fec36edf38650addc1e26a478567b1e6d1bdcc3ab9ef54678", "ja": "とにかく、毎日メッセージ送るから、ちゃんと見て！\n{$P$}くんだけが頼りなんだから！", "zh": "总之，我每天都会给你发消息，所以一定要好好看！\n我只能依靠{$P$}了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
